<h2>Three statutes, one policy</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Provision</th><th>Scope</th><th>Trigger</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Section 22, Hindu Marriage Act, 1955</td><td>All proceedings under the HMA — divorce, nullity, restitution, judicial separation</td><td>Desire of either party, or the court\'s own view; publication barred except permitted HC/SC judgments</td></tr>
